`server.js` will serve the dashboard to anyone who can reach the machine
it's running on, and now nobody gets in without the ID/password. What I
cannot do from inside this chat session is create an account on a
hosting platform on your behalf and push this app there myself — that
needs your own login on that platform (same reason I used your own
